ArduGolf: 3D minigolf for Arduboy, by Tiberius Brown (original Arduboy game).
Source used: the game/ directory of https://github.com/apfxtech/FlipperGolf
at 5242af5e94ab2b63c41a3a87d9a6471d9df64ed4 (a Flipper Zero port whose game/
code is the Arduboy original, host-independent). License: MPL-2.0 (LICENSE);
the files here keep their upstream form (source files are unmodified).
Built with ARDUGOLF_FX=0: the 18 default holes are in levels_default.hpp
(program memory) and the score is kept in the EEPROM file, so no data file is
needed. ardugolf_rb.cpp is the Rockbox host glue and game description.
